<figure class="cache-figure" data-cluster-routing>
 <p class="figure-title">The slot stays with the key; the owner can change</p>
 <div class="cache-controls"><button data-tag>Use shared hash tag</button><button data-reset>Reset keys</button></div>
 <div class="cluster-key-inputs"><label>First key <input data-key="0" value="card:42" maxlength="128" spellcheck="false" /></label><label>Second key <input data-key="1" value="stock:42" maxlength="128" spellcheck="false" /></label></div>
 <div class="cluster-slot-owners"><span>A<br /><small>0–5,460</small></span><span>B<br /><small>5,461–10,922</small></span><span>C<br /><small>10,923–16,383</small></span></div>
 {[0,1].map(i=><div class="cluster-key-route" data-route={i}><div class="cluster-slot-track"><i></i></div><p><b>{i===0?'First':'Second'} key</b> hashes <code data-hashed></code> → slot <strong data-slot></strong> → primary <strong data-owner></strong></p></div>)}
 <p class="explanation" data-explanation aria-live="polite"></p>
 <figcaption>Edit either key or use the shared tag. Marker positions use the actual CRC16/XMODEM slot calculation on UTF-8 bytes. The three fixed ownership ranges match the native lab. Equal slot numbers permit ordinary multi-key operations; merely sharing a primary is insufficient. This figure does not connect to Redis.</figcaption>
</figure>
<script>
import{hashInput,keySlot,slotOwner}from'../../lib/caching/cluster.mjs';
document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-cluster-routing]').forEach(root=>{const inputs=Array.from(root.querySelectorAll<HTMLInputElement>('[data-key]'));const render=()=>{const slots=inputs.map(input=>keySlot(input.value));inputs.forEach((input,i)=>{const row=root.querySelector<HTMLElement>(`[data-route="${i}"]`)!;row.querySelector('i')!.style.left=`${slots[i]/16383*100}%`;row.querySelector('[data-hashed]')!.textContent=JSON.stringify(hashInput(input.value));row.querySelector('[data-slot]')!.textContent=slots[i].toLocaleString('en-GB');row.querySelector('[data-owner]')!.textContent=slotOwner(slots[i]);});root.querySelector('[data-explanation]')!.textContent=slots[0]===slots[1]?`Both keys map to slot ${slots[0].toLocaleString('en-GB')}. In this stable topology they can participate in one MGET or a same-slot transaction.`:slotOwner(slots[0])===slotOwner(slots[1])?'Both happen to be on the same primary, but their slots differ. One ordinary MGET across them is still CROSSSLOT.':'These keys occupy different slots and different primaries. An ordinary MGET across them is CROSSSLOT.';};inputs.forEach(i=>i.oninput=render);root.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-tag]')!.onclick=()=>{inputs[0].value='card:{42}:a';inputs[1].value='card:{42}:b';render();};root.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-reset]')!.onclick=()=>{inputs[0].value='card:42';inputs[1].value='stock:42';render();};render();});
</script>
